      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/secrets.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "After any change",
      "prov:value": "1. records the mechanism, the secret **name**, and the expiry or `rotateBy`\n   date — never the value;\n2. runs `secrets:check` once it exists (bean `jzba`; until then, says that no\n   checker covers it rather than reporting clean);\n3. dispatches one workflow that uses the credential, if a rule grants it\n   `dispatch-workflow`, and reports green or red.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean jzba"
